[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 39 Don't drop it!",
    "start": 0.77,
    "end": 4.912,
    "zh": "第39课 别摔了它！",
    "zh_hant": "第39課 別摔了它！"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then",
    "start": 6.253,
    "end": 9.134,
    "zh": "听录音，然后",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "answer this question.",
    "start": 8.915,
    "end": 10.815,
    "zh": "回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Where does Sam put the vase in the end?",
    "start": 12.436,
    "end": 16.598,
    "zh": "萨姆最后把花瓶放在哪里了？",
    "zh_hant": "薩姆最後把花瓶放在哪裡了？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "What are you going to do with that vase,",
    "start": 18.439,
    "end": 22.521,
    "zh": "你打算怎么处理那个花瓶，",
    "zh_hant": "你打算怎麼處理那個花瓶，"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Penny?",
    "start": 22.261,
    "end": 23.101,
    "zh": "彭妮？",
    "zh_hant": "彭妮？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "I'm going to put it on this table, Sam.",
    "start": 24.142,
    "end": 28.124,
    "zh": "我打算把它放在这张桌子上，萨姆。",
    "zh_hant": "我打算把它放在這張桌子上，薩姆。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "Don't do that.",
    "start": 29.065,
    "end": 30.765,
    "zh": "别那样做。",
    "zh_hant": "別那樣做。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "Give it to me.",
    "start": 31.346,
    "end": 32.886,
    "zh": "把它给我。",
    "zh_hant": "把它給我。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "What are you going to do with it?",
    "start": 33.647,
    "end": 36.548,
    "zh": "你打算怎么处理它？",
    "zh_hant": "你打算怎麼處理它？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "I'm going to put it here,",
    "start": 37.469,
    "end": 40.05,
    "zh": "我打算把它放在这里，",
    "zh_hant": "我打算把它放在這裡，"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "in front of the window.",
    "start": 40.411,
    "end": 42.573,
    "zh": "窗户前面。",
    "zh_hant": "窗戶前面。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Be careful!",
    "start": 42.933,
    "end": 44.594,
    "zh": "小心！",
    "zh_hant": "小心！"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "Don't drop it!",
    "start": 44.715,
    "end": 46.436,
    "zh": "别摔了它！",
    "zh_hant": "別摔了它！"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Don't put it there, Sam.",
    "start": 47.317,
    "end": 50.019,
    "zh": "别把它放在那里，萨姆。",
    "zh_hant": "別把它放在那裡，薩姆。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "Put it here, on this shelf.",
    "start": 50.22,
    "end": 53.482,
    "zh": "把它放在这里，在这个架子上。",
    "zh_hant": "把它放在這裡，在這個架子上。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "There we are!",
    "start": 54.703,
    "end": 56.344,
    "zh": "就这样！",
    "zh_hant": "就這樣！"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "It's a lovely vase.",
    "start": 56.705,
    "end": 58.786,
    "zh": "这是个漂亮的花瓶。",
    "zh_hant": "這是個漂亮的花瓶。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Those flowers are lovely, too.",
    "start": 59.467,
    "end": 62.75,
    "zh": "那些花也很漂亮。",
    "zh_hant": "那些花也很漂亮。"
  }
]
